  "problem": "The values of functions $f(x)$ and $g(x)$ and their derivatives at $x=2$ are given in the table below.\n\n| $x$ | $f(x)$ | $g(x)$ | ${f}^{′}(x)$ | ${g}^{′}(x)$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $2$ | $4$ | $3$ | $5$ | $1$ |\n\nIf $h(x)=(f(x)+1)(2g(x)-2),$ compute ${h}^{′}(2).$",
